// The reference plugin's manifest. It declares no fonts, images or copy
// overrides, and that is the whole decision:
//
// - the five faces the player embeds are addressed by family and weight, so a
//   font declaration here would ship a second copy of a face the binary holds;
// - the reference look draws no shipped art (the title backdrop is the pack's);
// - every string these trees show is the copy table's (`engine/src/copy.rs`).
//   Restating one here would make two owners of one string, so variant E changes
//   layout, not words (slice-1 design note, "The engine's copy table (#104)").
(
    format_version: 1,
    name: "Reference",
    numbering: "arabic",
)
